{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "3f4b5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d-3e4f5a6b7c8d",
    "name": "Ciayumajakuning Smart Tourism API",
    "description": "Koleksi API Lengkap untuk Smart Tourism Ciayumajakuning (Indramayu, Cirebon, Majalengka, Kuningan).\n\n**Prasyarat:**\n1. Atur variabel `baseUrl` (default: `http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1`)\n2. Login sebagai admin untuk mendapatkan `accessToken` jika ingin akses endpoint admin.\n3. Untuk chatbot, jalankan `Ask Chatbot` dulu lalu pakai `chatbotSessionToken` yang tersimpan otomatis di `Get History`.\n4. Masukkan `accessToken` di tab Authorization koleksi ini (Type: Bearer Token) hanya untuk request yang butuh auth.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login Admin",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"admin@smarttourism.id\",\n    \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "json": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Wisata",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Wisata",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wisata?wilayah=Indramayu&sort_by=rating&order=desc",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["wisata"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "wilayah",
                  "value": "Indramayu"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sort_by",
                  "value": "rating"
                },
                {
                  "key": "order",
                  "value": "desc"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Detail Wisata",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wisata/WIS-IDM-001",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["wisata", "WIS-IDM-001"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
